OL,3,ABurnham's Brexit reset deal at risk
OL,4,Aunless UK cuts European student fees,
OL,5,AEU officials say
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham is in Brussels where he's
OL,8,Ftrying to secure a new UK-EU deal,
OL,9,Fcovering issues such as youth mobility,
OL,10,Ffood exports, carbon emissions and
OL,11,Fmigration
OL,13,FBut EU officials say the deal won't
OL,14,Fhappen unless the prime minister agrees
OL,15,Fto cut university tuition fees for
OL,16,FEuropean students
OL,18,FThe youth mobility scheme is expected
OL,19,Fto allow 100,000 young people from the
OL,20,FEU to travel, work and study in the UK
OL,21,Fper year - the same number of young
OL,22,FBritons would be allowed into Europe
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
