OL,3,ABurnham's Brexit reset deal at risk
OL,4,Aunless UK cuts European student fees,
OL,5,AEU officials say
OL,6,
OL,7,FDowning Street has not commented on the
OL,8,Fdetails, as EU officials say talks are
OL,9,Falso ongoing on the UK joining the
OL,10,Fbloc's internal electricity market in
OL,11,Fexchange for contributions to the EU
OL,12,Fbudget
OL,14,FSpeaking to the BBC earlier, Reform's
OL,15,FNigel Farage - a prominent Brexit
OL,16,Fcampaigner - said the PM has no
OL,17,F"democratic mandate to do any of this"
OL,18,F- here's what other political leaders
OL,19,Fare saying
